    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Trigger:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] [[lookup @activation.condition activity=5HvUimjPYvPVM4g7]]. <em>Response:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] gives itself Resistance to that instance of damage and gains [[/healing temp]].</p><section id=\"secret-me52mQIKaehg7iLh\" class=\"secret\"><p><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Foundry Note</strong></span></p><p class=\"p2\">This feature also provides an <strong>Active Effect (AE)</strong> that will modify this creature's <strong>damage resistances</strong>. You can enable the damage resistance of your choice in the character sheet's effects tab.</p></section>",
